ategories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"59I-SbhRE1wYzPQV0ZAdrg","review_id":"vQbQye4q6dzWAA2s5e9IqQ","date":"2016-06-03T20:51:15","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9392476081848145,"text_excerpt":"After an unsuccessful attempt to surprise my office friends with District Donuts (due to the long line) on National Donut Day, I searched Yelp for other options closer to my workplace. There doesn't seem to be many available options when it comes to donuts in NOLA. But alas! I found Sweet Things in the French Quarter with very new reviews! Their other location had excellent reviews as well, so I marched right on in! The place was pretty empty, after all, it was 8AM and this place is right on the corner of Bourbon St. The Barista/Bartender was very friendly and the customers that came in and out were chipper, too (they were offering a free donut, sure to make most happy). I bought a dozen ..."},{"business_id":"59I-SbhRE1wYzPQV0ZAdrg","review_id":"M7JNKDdWNwFzaszP5BqHKw","date":"2018-09-05T00:29:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9300671815872192,"text_excerpt":"Thank goodness for donuts, right? Especially when they are as delicious as the donuts at Sweet Things & Grill. I was actually walking to breakfast while in New Orleans, passed this place and told myself I had to get a donut on my way back- thank goodness I did. Now they do serve food here, but I was only interested in the delicious donuts. Remember, they're delicious. I walked up and was immediately greeted by such a nice woman who worked there. We chatted briefly and let me know the donuts were $2 a piece so I ordered a donut twist and a glazed with blueberry frosting. These yeast donuts were amazing. So fresh. So sweet. Truly delicious. These put those chains to shame, honestly. If I co..."},{"business_id":"59I-SbhRE1wYzPQV0ZAdrg","review_id":"bCglY96ITb_YxzJgrtByiQ","date":"2018-03-15T13:52:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9113551378250122,"text_excerpt":"Great donuts. Service was great. They went out of their way to help us out. Great spot to get a donut or a good breakfast biscuit while walking around the French quarter in the morning."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"59I-SbhRE1wYzPQV0ZAdrg","photo_id":"jJc1eRYZXVGAX_VOXCnYtQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/jJc1eRYZXVGAX_VOXCnYtQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.949451208114624},{"business_id":"59I-SbhRE1wYzPQV0ZAdrg","photo_id":"2tu3EvRvoxQxRBFS8V-k7w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/2tu3EvRvoxQxRBFS8V-k7w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9494511485099792}]},"notebook_case":null}
